.DS_Store
agent_service/.venv/
outputs/
# data/: ignore regeneratable/runtime subtrees individually so config under
# data/ (faq.json, eval/, ops/*.json) can be tracked.
#
# Ignored (not reproducible from a clean clone on purpose, or runtime
# state that must never be committed):
#   data/sources/       raw knowledge corpus (internal IT documents)
#                       including images under data/sources/assets/
#   data/index/          built BM25/embedding index, regenerated via
#                         `uv run rag-index`
#   data/conversations/  Conversation Repository FILE-mode store; runtime
#                         state, may contain user message text
#   data/portal_drafts/  draft image bundles uploaded via Knowledge Portal
#   data/portal_state/   Portal FILE-mode repository state
#   data/releases/       published release artifacts built by the Portal
#   data/portal_originals/ private original-asset store (local/GCS boundary)
#   data/ops/events/     operational event FILE-mode store
#   data/ops/exports/    async export job artifacts
#   data/ops/freshness/  freshness tracker runtime state
#   data/ops/sources/    source-catalog records written by local portal runs
#   data/ops/aggregates/ daily aggregate store (regenerated)
#   data/ops/audit/      append-only audit log
#   data/ops/tickets.json / phase2/budgets.json — local mutable working sets
#
# Tracked (small, hand-curated configuration/fixtures the service's
# behavior depends on — spec §7.2 FAQ config, §18.7 A/B/eval fixtures):
#   data/faq.json
#   data/eval/
#   data/ops/*taxonomy*, metrics, schemas, faqs, golden_evals, role matrix
data/sources/
data/index/
data/conversations/
data/portal_drafts/
data/portal_state/
data/releases/
data/portal_originals/
data/ops/events/
data/ops/exports/
data/ops/freshness/
data/ops/sources/
data/ops/aggregates/
data/ops/audit/
data/ops/tickets.json
data/ops/workbench_state.json
data/ops/phase2/budgets.json
data/ops/evaluations/fixtures/
data/ops/evaluations/gates/
data/ops/evaluations/jobs/

# Evaluation run logs are transient; keep curated JSON reports trackable.
data/eval/reports/*.log
data/eval/reports/debug-*.json
data/eval/reports/*-harness-smoke.json
data/eval/reports/*-live-smoke*.json

# Terraform local state and secrets (see infra/terraform/README.md)
**/.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
.terraform.tfstate.lock.info
infra/terraform/terraform.tfvars
crash.log
crash.*.log
*.lock
.agents/
skills-lock.json

# Local checkout of poirotw66/pdf-to-markdown-converter (Gemini Vision)
services/pdf_converter/upstream/
